  "body": "Unless I missed something, step 4.1 in the [add an allowed Bluetooth device](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#add-device-to-storage) algorithm handles the case where no device is found in `allowedDevices` but:\n- does not initialize `allowedDevice`, whereas the starting point is \"If one [`allowedDevice`] is not found\"\n- does not add the `allowedDevice` to the storage, which it probably should?\n",
